  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You say I should be on top of the world, but I'm not feeling much",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You know, I used to think I could fly, now I'm just holding on",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Yeah, I'm laughing in a room full of strangers on the verge of tears",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Yeah, I should be on top of the world, but, yet, I'm right here",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Oh, 'cause every time (Every time)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You look at me, it's never enough for you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "It can't be fair to me (Fair to me)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "'Cause, boy, you know I'm so damn in love with you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Oh, ooh-ooh",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I've been stuck seeing your face in everyone",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Shouldn't have played in your game of fun",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Now I don't think I'm okay, you never go away",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Oh, enjoy the show, you seem to love when I'm alone",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You like to care until you don't",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Now I don't think I'm okay, you never go away",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Oh, ooh-ooh (Oh, ooh-ooh, ooh)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I should be on top of the world, but I've been falling down",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And each day gets a little bit worse when you're not around (Oh, oh)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Was driving and I thought that I saw you and I almost crashed",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "The sad part is if the roles were reversed, you would've drove right past",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
